Dual licensing
--------------
The `enterprise/` subtree of this repository is NOT covered by the AGPL
and is distributed under a separate commercial license — see
`enterprise/LICENSE-ENTERPRISE.md`. Contributions accepted into Yuzu
require a signed Contributor License Agreement (see `CLA.md`) that
